msgid ""
"Plot the free energy surface per CV of interest. Note that the order of CVs "
"in: ``` for i in $(echo CV1 CV2 CV3 etc);do .. ``` needs to follow the order"
" these CVs appear as columns in the ```COLVAR``` file."
msgstr ""

